    <div class="tcard tful"><span class="tqm">"</span><p class="ttext">Navigating a redundancy after 14 years in the same organisation is not a straightforward thing, professionally or personally. Steph understood both dimensions from day one and structured her support accordingly. What impressed me most was how current and specific her market knowledge is. She understood exactly how hiring decisions are made at a senior level, where the real opportunities sit beyond the advertised roles, and how to position a candidate who hasn't actively job searched in years. Her interview preparation was meticulous, tailored to my industry and the specific roles I was targeting. The weekly accountability sessions kept me focused and moving during a process that can easily stall. Responsive, precise, and genuinely invested. I'd recommend her to any senior professional without hesitation.</p><div class="tauth"><div class="tname">Jack</div><div class="trole">Senior Technical Analyst and IT Manager, Retail</div></div></div>
    <div class="tcard"><span class="tqm">"</span><p class="ttext">Before I started working with Steph, I thought I just needed help polishing my CV. What I actually got was a complete rethinking of how I was showing up professionally. She helped me understand that your digital footprint is now just as important as your track record. Every element was considered and refined. The interview preparation was genuinely impressive.</p><div class="tauth"><div class="tname">Florence</div><div class="trole">Risk and Compliance Expert, Banking and Financial Services</div></div></div>
    <div class="tcard"><span class="tqm">"</span><p class="ttext">Steph has been an outstanding mentor who provided practical advice and continuous support throughout my job search journey. Her guidance helped me better understand suitable roles and approach opportunities with confidence. I'm grateful for her encouragement and highly recommend her.</p><div class="tauth"><div class="tname">Yamini</div><div class="trole">Customer Success Manager, Government Technology</div></div></div>
    <div class="tcard"><span class="tqm">"</span><p class="ttext">Steph provided clear advice on navigating the current job market, particularly around positioning, networking, and approaching opportunities more strategically. Our conversations helped me gain a better understanding of how to present my experience more effectively. I appreciated her structured and supportive approach.</p><div class="tauth"><div class="tname">Lingling</div><div class="trole">University Admissions Officer, Education</div></div></div>
    <div class="tcard"><span class="tqm">"</span><p class="ttext">What immediately stood out was her genuine professionalism and incredible listening skills. It never felt like I was getting boilerplate advice. Steph took the time to truly hear my situation and goals, asking thoughtful questions to understand my unique circumstances. This personalised approach led to truly unique and actionable advice that made a real difference.</p><div class="tauth"><div class="tname">Partha</div><div class="trole">Senior Product Owner, Information Technology and Cybersecurity</div></div></div>
    <div class="tcard"><span class="tqm">"</span><p class="ttext">Every counsel was informed, every concern was heard, and every preference was respected. Beyond her expertise, Steph provided patient and thoughtful emotional support. She showed empathy, understanding, and encouragement at every step, which made a meaningful difference. I would enthusiastically recommend Steph to anyone seeking an exceptional career coach.</p><div class="tauth"><div class="tname">Danielle</div><div class="trole">Executive Administration Professional, Corporate Travel Management</div></div></div>
    <div class="tcard"><span class="tqm">"</span><p class="ttext">Working with Steph turned what could have been an incredibly stressful career transition into one of the most clarifying experiences of my professional life. She took the time to understand my background, my strengths, and where I genuinely wanted to go next, then built a custom strategy around that. With Steph's guidance, I landed a role I'm genuinely excited about, faster than I would have on my own.</p><div class="tauth"><div class="tname">Sara</div><div class="trole">Senior Clinical Research Professional, Medical and Pharmaceuticals</div></div></div>
    <div class="tcard"><span class="tqm">"</span><p class="ttext">Within 2 weeks, I noticed my usual tasks felt so much easier when I approached them from a place of clarity and confidence. Steph continued to follow up with me even after the program finished, which showed just how much she cares. Being coached by her was very insightful.</p><div class="tauth"><div class="tname">Samantha</div><div class="trole">Solicitor, Civil and Commercial Litigation</div></div></div>
    <div class="tcard"><span class="tqm">"</span><p class="ttext">After reaching out to Steph, I was able to adopt simple strategies that created more space in my life for the things I love and be more assertive with my superiors to get the support and recognition I deserved. In a short time, we identified and released emotional blocks that were affecting my ability to set clear boundaries, and recalibrated my sense of self-worth.</p><div class="tauth"><div class="tname">Czerina</div><div class="trole">Consultant and Project Officer, Change Management</div></div></div>
  </div>
</div></div>

<div class="sw" style="background:var(--td);"><div class="sec">
  <div class="lbl">Frequently Asked Questions</div>
  <h2 class="h2">What You Need<br>to Know</h2>
  <div class="fl">
    <div class="fi"><button class="fq" onclick="tFaq(this)"><span>Who is this coaching designed for?</span><span class="ficon">+</span></button><div class="fa">This coaching is designed for mid-level to senior executives who are actively navigating a career transition or job search. Whether you have been made redundant, are proactively seeking your next move, or have been searching without the results you expected, these sessions are built for the level of sophistication and nuance your search demands.</div></div>
    <div class="fi"><button class="fq" onclick="tFaq(this)"><span>How are sessions delivered?</span><span class="ficon">+</span></button><div class="fa">All sessions are delivered online as 60-minute one-on-one coaching calls. Between sessions, you have access to Steph via phone and email for questions, feedback, and accountability check-ins. Sessions are valid for 90 days (Executive Track) or 120 days (Executive Edge) from your start date.</div></div>
    <div class="fi"><button class="fq" onclick="tFaq(this)"><span>What is included beyond the sessions themselves?</span><span class="ficon">+</span></button><div class="fa">Every package includes a CV and LinkedIn audit, interview preparation, job search strategy, and a structured accountability plan. The Executive Edge also includes salary negotiation coaching and executive presence positioning, with support covering the full arc of your search from first application through to signed offer.</div></div>
    <div class="fi"><button class="fq" onclick="tFaq(this)"><span>How quickly can I expect results?</span><span class="ficon">+</span></button><div class="fa">Research shows that career coaching reduces average search time by one to two months. Many clients notice meaningful shifts within the first two to three sessions, including stronger recruiter engagement, clearer positioning, and greater confidence in interviews.</div></div>
    <div class="fi"><button class="fq" onclick="tFaq(this)"><span>What if I have questions before booking?</span><span class="ficon">+</span></button><div class="fa">You are welcome to reach out directly at hello@stephdarmanin.com before committing to a package. Steph is happy to answer any questions and help you determine which option is the right fit. Availability is limited, so early enquiries are encouraged.</div></div>
